<?php
return ['name' => 'attuned_yi_wood_the_poet', 'displayTitle' => ['en' => 'Attuned Yi Wood – The Poet', 'zh' => '身弱乙木'], 'locales' => ['en' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Attuned Yi Wood is like wisteria vines and delicate flowers – graceful, soft, and full of life. Unlike Empowered Yi Wood, it lacks the rigidity to stand tall alone. Yet its strength isn\'t in resisting head-on, it\'s in following the flow, twisting and twining until it finds a place to hold on. With gentle demeanor, artistic expression, and sensitive emotions, Attuned Yi Wood touches the world around it deeply. There is strength in this softness. The key is discovering Attuned Yi Wood\'s irreplaceable uniqueness, and using creativity and heart to create value that only it can bring.</p><p>Sensitive and observant: You have natural empathy and notice subtle shifts in environment and people\'s moods.<br/>Strategic pacifist: You prefer to handle matters indirectly and tactfully, using strategy and leverage.<br/>Principled core: Though you appear gentle, you have an inner scholar\'s backbone.</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>Water and Wood. Like vines needing water and a lattice, you require nourishment and support to grow strong. Welcoming flowing Water energy and additional Wood (growth) energy helps you draw power from your flexibility, allowing strength to emerge from your gentle nature.</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>Wealth</h4><p>Your wealth grows in a \'slow and steady\' stream rather than big windfalls – avoid greed or trying to get rich quick. Partnerships or joint ventures bring prosperity; you can also monetize knowledge, patents, or artistic creations over time. Steady collaborations and creative products will yield value. In short, don\'t rush for quick gains – consistent effort and patience lead to lasting financial growth.</p><h4>Health</h4><p>Be mindful of liver and gallbladder health – avoid late nights and greasy food, keep your diet light and balanced. Watch for nervous fatigue: remember to relax and reduce stress regularly. Prevent bone and muscle strain by not sitting or standing too long and by doing gentle stretches. In spring, you may have allergies – guard against wind and sand and minimize exposure to allergens.</p><h4>Emotional Wellbeing</h4><p>When facing tough choices, you\'re prone to paralyzing indecision and internal conflict. To nourish your spirit, engage in slow-paced, calming hobbies. Try a tea ceremony, calligraphy, or similar meditative arts to soothe your nerves. These practices quiet your mind and strengthen your resolve, allowing your gentle strength to surface when you need it most.</p><h4>Career Pathways</h4><p>Where You Flourish: Education: Schools (especially early childhood or higher education), research institutes, online education – places where your patience and gentle guidance help others grow. Culture & Media: Publishing, writing, library science – careers involving literature, archives or journalism suit your thoughtful nature. Consulting & Services: Counseling psychology, social work, non-profit organizations – roles where you can help and support others one-on-one or in communities. Research & Tech: Fundamental scientific research or data management – behind-the-scenes roles where careful analysis and persistence pay off. Health & Wellness: Traditional medicine, nutrition, yoga instruction, wellness coaching – healing fields where your caring approach shines. Design & Crafts: Fashion design, graphic design, floral design, handicrafts – creative industries where your artistic eye and attention to detail create beauty. Where Energy Feels Drained: Judiciary & Military: Courtrooms, policing, or military life could be too rigid and confrontational for your comfort. Heavy Machinery: Industries like steel, heavy equipment manufacturing – harsh settings that clash with your delicate sensibilities. High-Risk Finance: Investment banking or high-frequency trading demand aggression and quick, risky moves that might overwhelm you. Construction & Civil Engineering: Rough-and-tumble construction sites or big engineering projects might stress your need for stability and calm. Mining & Heavy Industry: Mining operations, large-scale logistics – these lack the human touch and creativity you crave.</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Gui Water: A friend who eases your overthinking and sharpens your insight.</li><li>Bing Fire: A friend with warm personality who can dispel gloomy moods and motivate you.</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Ren Water: An inspiring partner who leads you out of mental dead-ends and broadens horizons.</li><li>Ji Earth: A patient, accepting partner who can absorb negative emotions and provide comfortable life.</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Katherine Johnson: The NASA mathematician who broke race and gender barriers (brilliant and meticulous, with a gentle determination that quietly changed history)</li><li>Oprah Winfrey: Media mogul and philanthropist known for empathy and empowering others, focusing on education and women\'s rights</li><li>Beyoncé Knowles: Singer and philanthropist who channels deep emotion and creativity into her art and charity</li><li>Louis Pasteur: Father of microbiology, inventor of pasteurization and vaccines, who changed the world through patient, diligent research</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Lei Jun: Founder of Xiaomi Technology, who built success with a calm, persistent approach in a competitive industry</li><li>Liu Qiangdong (Richard Liu): Founder of JD.com, quietly strategic in revolutionizing e-commerce</li><li>Deng Jiaxian: Physicist and key figure in China\'s atomic bomb project, who worked humbly behind the scenes to lay a foundation for national defense</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Avoid wearing denim too often (a minor superstition to keep in mind – softer fabrics align better with your gentle energy)</li><li>When taking public transport, try to sit by the window to recharge with passing scenery</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Green & Blue (Wood/Water): Green symbolizes life and growth; blue represents nourishment and flow. Together, green-blue tones boost your vitality and bring a constant source of calm energy. Incorporate green and blue items in your daily life (clothes, décor, personal items) as if \'feeding\' yourself steady nutrients, helping you grow confidently and peacefully.</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>East (Wood): Eastern energy embodies growth and vigor. Facing east (or placing your work/study area on the east side) easily stimulates your thinking and creative inspiration. It\'s like a vine finding sunlight – your ideas unfurl naturally.</li><li>North (Water): Northern energy signifies flow and change, enhancing adaptability. Spending time facing north or placing important items in the northern part of your space helps you stay flexible and resilient through life\'s ups and downs.</li></ul>']]], 'zh' => ['sections' => ['overview' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>乙木如藤萝花草，姿态婀娜，柔美灵动。身弱则韧性不足，难以独立挺立于天地之间。它的力量，不在于硬抗，而在于顺势而生，以迂回缠绕之法，找到自己在环境中的立足之处。</p><p>细腻敏锐：具备天然的共情力，能察觉环境与人心的微妙变化。<br/>善用策略：处事懂得迂回周旋，善于借力打力，但关键时刻需避免过度谨慎。<br/>坚守原则：内心有文人风骨，面对原则问题展现柔中带刚的韧性，常以退为进达成目标。</p>'], 'love' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<p>身弱乙木，喜用神：水 / 木。乙木如藤如草，身弱时更需要滋养与支撑，才能从柔韧中生长出力量。</p>'], 'career' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<h4>财富运势</h4><p>细水长流型财富积累，忌贪多求快。适合跟人合伙一起赚钱，也可通过知识专利、艺术创作实现价值。</p><h4>健康隐患</h4><p>注意肝胆健康，避免熬夜，少吃油腻食物；警惕神经疲劳，放松心情，减少压力；预防筋骨劳损，避免久坐久站；春季易过敏，预防风沙，少接触过敏原。</p><h4>情绪管理</h4><p>在面对抉择时容易产生纠结内耗的情绪。建议通过茶道、书法等慢节奏活动养神。</p><h4>职业管理</h4><p>推荐行业：文化教育：教育、教学、编辑、写作。农林业：农作、园艺、林业。生态旅游：旅游、导游、生态旅游开发。心理咨询：心理治疗、心理辅导。文化传播：媒体、出版、广告。养生护理：医务护理、保健品、养生。教育服务业：培训、咨询、教育培训。慎重行业：机械制造业：重工、机械、自动化、汽车制造。法律审计：律师、审计、合规、金融风控。地产建筑：房地产、建筑工程、矿业。能源动力：电力、燃气、石油、新能源。</p>'], 'relationship_friends' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>癸水：可以化解你的过度纠结，提升你的洞察力。</li><li>丙火：个性温暖，可以驱散你阴郁的情绪，增加行动力。</li></ul>'], 'relationship_couple' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>壬水：能够引领你走出思维困局，拓宽人生的选择。</li><li>己土：能接纳你的负面情绪，也能为你提供更好的物质生活。</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_international' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>Katherine Johnson：打破种族歧视和性别壁垒的非裔女性NASA数学家</li><li>Oprah Winfrey：媒体巨头与慈善家，关注教育、女性赋权与灾后重建</li><li>Beyoncé Knowles：歌手与慈善家</li><li>Louis Pasteur：微生物学之父，发明巴氏杀菌法，研发狂犬病疫苗</li></ul>'], 'celebrities_domestic' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>雷军：小米科技创始人</li><li>余华：知名作家</li><li>刘强东：京东创始人</li><li>沈从文：文学家，晚年从事古代服饰研究，保护文化遗产</li><li>邓稼先：两弹元勋，奠定国防科技基石</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_dailyTips' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>少穿牛仔裤</li><li>坐公共交通出行时多选靠窗位置</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_color' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>绿色 / 蓝色（水木）：绿色象征生命与成长，蓝色代表滋润与流动。这两种颜色能帮助乙木增强生命力，就像获得源源不断的滋养。</li></ul>'], 'luckSuggestion_location' => ['title' => '', 'content' => '<ul><li>东方（木）：东方的能量象征生长与蓬勃。在这个方位更容易激发思考和创意灵感。</li><li>北方（水）：北方的能量象征流动与变化，能增强乙木的应变能力。</li></ul>']]]], 'version' => 1];
